  "id": "ephesians-3-1-13",
  "reference": "Ephesians 3:1-13",
  "title": "Literary Design of Ephesians 3:1-13",
  "caption": "<bp-cite>Ephesians 3:1-13</bp-cite>. Translation and Literary Design by Tim Mackie for BibleProject Classroom: Ephesians (2019).",
  "updatedAt": "2024-02-05T18:32:51.000Z",
  "usx": null,
  "html": "<div class=\"group\">\n  <div class=\"group\"><sup>1</sup> For this reason, I Paul, the prisoner</div>\n  <div class=\"group\" indent=\"4\">\n    <div class=\"group\">\n      <div class=\"group\" indent=\"17\">of the Messiah Jesus</div>\n      <div class=\"group\" indent=\"17\">on behalf of y’all the nations —</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"group\">\n    <div class=\"group\"><sup>2</sup> if indeed y’all have heard</div>\n    <div class=\"group\" indent=\"16\">of the arranged plan</div>\n    <div class=\"group\" indent=\"28\">\n      <div class=\"group\">of the grace of God</div>\n      <div class=\"group\" indent=\"5\">which was given to me</div>\n      <div class=\"group\" indent=\"14\">for y’all,</div>\n      <div class=\"group\"><sup>3</sup> that it would be made known to me</div>\n      <div class=\"group\" indent=\"18\">\n        <div class=\"group\">according to revelation</div>\n        <div class=\"group\">at the open-secret,</div>\n        <div class=\"group\" indent=\"8\">\n          <div class=\"group\">just as I earlier wrote about in brief,</div>\n          <div class=\"group\"><sup>4</sup> into which you are,</div>\n          <div class=\"group\" indent=\"10\">\n            <div class=\"group\">after reading,</div>\n            <div class=\"group\">able to comprehend my <bp-mark variant=\"text\" color=\"black\">insight</bp-mark></div>\n            <div class=\"group\" indent=\"19\">\n              <div class=\"group\"><bp-mark variant=\"text\" color=\"black\">into</bp-mark> the open-secret</div>\n              <div class=\"group\" indent=\"6\">\n                <div class=\"group\">of the Messiah,</div>\n                <div class=\"group\"><sup>5</sup> which in other generations</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"8\">was not made known</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"15\">to the sons of humanity</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"15\">as it is now revealed</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"24\">by the Spirit</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"24\">to his holy apostles and prophets,</div>\n                <div class=\"group\"><sup>6</sup> that the nations are</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"14\">co-inheritors</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"11\">and co-body-members</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"11\">and co-possessors</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"14\">of the promise</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"14\">in Messiah Jesus</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"14\">through the good news,</div>\n                <div class=\"group\" indent=\"27\">\n                  <div class=\"group\"><sup>7</sup> of which I became a servant</div>\n                  <div class=\"group\" indent=\"17\">according to the gift</div>\n                  <div class=\"group\" indent=\"25\">of God’s grace</div>\n                  <div class=\"group\" indent=\"32\">which was given to me</div>\n                  <div class=\"group\" indent=\"40\">in accordance with the</div>\n                  <div class=\"group\" indent=\"45\">working of his power.</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"group\">\n    <div class=\"group\"><sup>8</sup> To me,</div>\n    <div class=\"group\" indent=\"6\">the lowest in status of all the holy ones,</div>\n    <div class=\"group\" indent=\"6\">was given this grace,</div>\n    <div class=\"group\" indent=\"10\">\n      <div class=\"group\">to announce good news</div>\n      <div class=\"group\" indent=\"15\">to the nations</div>\n      <div class=\"group\" indent=\"15\">of the incomprehensible richness of the Messiah,</div>\n      <div class=\"group\"><sup>9</sup> and to illuminate</div>\n      <disv class=\"group\" indent=\"7\">\n        <div class=\"group\">for everyone</div>\n        <div class=\"group\">what is the arranged plan</div>\n        <div class=\"group\" indent=\"9\">\n          <div class=\"group\">of the open-secret</div>\n          <div class=\"group\">which was hidden from the ages in God,</div>\n          <div class=\"group\" indent=\"27\">who created all things,</div>\n          <div class=\"group\" indent=\"5\"><sup>10</sup> in order that now would be made known,</div>\n          <div class=\"group\" indent=\"32\">\n            <div class=\"group\">to the rulers</div>\n            <div class=\"group\">and to the authorities</div>\n            <div class=\"group\" indent=\"8\">in the heavenlies,</div>\n            <div class=\"group\">through the church,</div>\n            <div class=\"group\">the multi-faceted wisdom</div>\n            <div class=\"group\" indent=\"14\">of God,</div>\n            <div class=\"group\"><sup>11</sup> in accordance with the <bp-mark variant=\"text\" color=\"black\">plan</bp-mark></div>\n            <div class=\"group\" indent=\"19\">of the ages</div>\n            <div class=\"group\" indent=\"17\">\n              <div class=\"group\"><bp-mark variant=\"text\" color=\"black\">which</bp-mark> he accomplished</div>\n              <div class=\"group\" indent=\"8\">in Messiah Jesus our Lord,</div>\n              <div class=\"group\" indent=\"16\"><sup>12</sup> in whom we have</div>\n              <div class=\"group\" indent=\"27\">boldness and access with confidence</div>\n              <div class=\"group\" indent=\"27\">through his faithfulness [or: faith in him].</div>\n              <div class=\"group\"><sup>13</sup> Therefore, I request that there be no discouragement</div>\n              <div class=\"group\" indent=\"29\">about my difficulties</div>\n              <div class=\"group\" indent=\"37\">on your behalf,</div>\n              <div class=\"group\" indent=\"37\">which are your glory.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </disv>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}